    "en": {
      "trackName": "Glass 2048",
      "description": "The most polished 2048 game on the App Store. Glass 2048 reimagines the classic number merge puzzle with stunning liquid-glass visuals, smooth animations, and endless ways to customize. A relaxing yet addictive brain training game available on iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple Watch, and Apple TV with full Game Center support.\n\nWhy players love Glass 2048:\n  -\tPremium glass design with silky-smooth number merging\n  -\tDeep customization: tile colors, shapes, and mesmerizing backgrounds\n  -\tIntuitive drag and swipe controls that feel natural\n  -\tGentle haptics for an immersive puzzle experience\n  -\tCompete on Game Center leaderboards and unlock achievements\n\nMultiple game modes keep it fresh:\n  -\tClassic 2048 – the timeless and endlessly satisfying puzzle\n  -\tArcade Mode – use power-ups to boost your strategy\n  -\tFibonacci Mode – merge tiles in a unique mathematical twist\n  -\tBot Mode – watch automated gameplay at adjustable speed\n\nRelax, focus, and train your mind:\n  -\tA minimalist, modern design with liquid-glass effects\n  -\tConsistent gameplay sessions for strategy lovers\n  -\tPerfect for quick breaks or long puzzle runs\n  -\tA premium puzzle game that is both relaxing and addictive\n\nDownload now and enjoy the most satisfying 2048 puzzle game — where strategy meets relaxation.\n\nInspired by Gabriele Cirulli's original 2048.",
      "releaseNotes": "We're constantly improving Glass 2048! This update includes:\n- A new, organized About screen with version info.\n- Added credits for game sounds.\n- Fixes for score display on Apple Watch.\n\nThank you for playing!",
